{
  "experiment": "stage4_llmrouterbench",
  "description": "Stage 4: our router on LLMRouterBench (Li et al., arXiv 2601.07206), the benchmark of the Avengers-Pro authors, in its performance-cost setting: 13 flagship models, 10 datasets, 12,446 questions, the paper's own 70/30 split with its five seeds. The 70% is the warm start; the 30% test part is the stream, routed and scored block by block before it is learned from. Scored as in the paper: AvgAcc = mean over the datasets of the mean score, Cost = total USD on the test part. The data has no latency, so the score is quality and cost only.",
  "seeds": [42, 999, 2024, 2025, 3407],
  "data": {
